# Backend API base URL. Optional — when left unset the app picks it
# automatically:
#   • local dev  → "/api" (proxied by Vite to http://localhost:8000)
#   • production → https://smart-scid-5-cv.vercel.app/api
# Note: the base must include the "/api" prefix (endpoint paths start
# with "/v1/..."). Set this only to override the default.
VITE_API_URL=
